  "sourceTitle": "I built a Windows MCP server that uses the accessibility tree instead of screenshots — looking for honest feedback",
  "sourceBodyHash": "d8a67e6eec527750274c905a1deb1930a8ef91faae875abb70a663a5b5c5a523",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "partial",
  "importanceLevel": 4,
  "provider": "nowcoding",
  "requestedModel": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-12T15:49:22.843580Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-12T16:03:51.883600Z",
  "totalBlocks": 26,
  "translatedBlocks": 25,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "900d8255db167786",
      "translationZh": "我开发了 WinMind——一个面向本地/远程智能体的 Windows MCP 服务器，通过 Windows UI Automation（无障碍）树来操控应用，而不是依靠截图和像素点击。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0b24e5b3884e42f0",
      "translationZh": "大多数计算机操作智能体的工作方式大致如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ef8820d123696ce0",
      "translationZh": "将图像 token 发送给视觉模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1099ab839e2f23f4",
      "translationZh": "这种方式能用，但可能速度慢、消耗大量 token，还会让你的鼠标四处移动，并且可能在窗口被遮挡时失效。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1a8f440ab338e565",
      "translationZh": "WinMind 采用了不同的方法：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4d452fec6868e72b",
      "translationZh": "• 读取 Windows 已经提供的实际无障碍树——也就是 Narrator 和 NVDA 等工具使用的同一层",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "41ec4b441e6c4d84",
      "translationZh": "• 返回一棵紧凑、带编号的树，供智能体据此推理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6c7dd8dee8acec89",
      "translationZh": "• 使用应用自身的无障碍操作，而不是移动鼠标",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "afa0f2322347a214",
      "translationZh": "• 即使窗口位于其他窗口后面，也能与其交互",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aeddc1ce85ce29c6",
      "translationZh": "• 包含 ~222 个原生 Windows 工具，涵盖系统健康状况、网络、安全、虚拟桌面、媒体、文件、进程等方面",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9a6fffecea41f21d",
      "translationZh": "例如，模型可能会看到：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "08d6335b58b5ee8f",
      "translationZh": "├─ [20] textbox \"搜索或开始新聊天\" [set_value]",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b8e8a94412477aa7",
      "translationZh": "├─ [26] grid \"聊天列表\" (9)",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "706f71d19bb93b06",
      "translationZh": "│ ├─ [29] row \"Alex 昨天 照片\" [click]",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "99561f2422e0889f",
      "translationZh": "│ └─ [30] row \"学习小组 3 条未读消息 昨天\" [click]",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "25870828375341f5",
      "translationZh": "└─ [37] button \"发送文档\" [click]",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fd81d6580b9d9b04",
      "translationZh": "智能体不必费力判断某个东西在屏幕上的位置，只需这样做：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1543d78cb5b38043",
      "translationZh": "我额外花时间处理的问题",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a3a59ccc17ff7ed0",
      "translationZh": "• 被遮挡时会变成空白的 Chromium 应用——Discord、Spotify、VS Code、Steam 等。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "72b8cda4678fc3a5",
      "translationZh": "• 可能陷入自身循环的 WinUI 3 + WebView2 应用——尤其是 WhatsApp",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d9d5f2899379b48b",
      "translationZh": "• 网页点击悄无声息地不起作用，因为真正的处理程序绑定在内部元素上",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "99d1379498cdd132",
      "translationZh": "• 当窗口标题不是应用名称时，通过进程名称查找应用——例如，Spotify 使用歌曲名称作为窗口标题",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "727814cb4246f1bf",
      "translationZh": "• 工具的词元使用效率和风险标注",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c9b35bcbc5d59d83",
      "translationZh": "它还处于非常早期的阶段，所以如果大家能试用一下，试着把它弄出问题，并告诉我你们的想法，我会非常感激。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "49e02469a9e0900a",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/Cool-Statistician880 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
